iniparser
------------------------------------------
iniparser is a free stand-alone ini file parsing library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libiniparser-devel-4.3.2-1bl1
  libiniparser4-4.3.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.8-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ndevilla/iniparser

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ndevilla/iniparser/archive/refs/tags/v4.3.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack iniparser-4.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./iniparser-4.3.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/iniparser-4.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/iniparser-4.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libiniparser4-4.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libiniparser-devel-4.3.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(iniparser)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/iniparser.README
  /usr/share/doc/iniparser/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/iniparser/FAQ-en.md
  /usr/share/doc/iniparser/FAQ-zhcn.md
  /usr/share/doc/iniparser/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/iniparser/README.md

(libiniparser4)
  /usr/bin/cyginiparser-4.dll

(libiniparser-devel)
  /usr/include/iniparser/dictionary.h
  /usr/include/iniparser/iniparser.h
  /usr/include/iniparser/version.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/iniparser/iniparser-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/iniparser/iniparser-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/iniparser/iniparser-sharedTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/iniparser/iniparser-sharedTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libiniparser.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/iniparser.pc

